<urn:atm:triage:finding/RRG-HERMES-FLEET-NUDGE-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "RRG-HERMES-FLEET-NUDGE-001" ;
  triage:title "hermes-harness agents on rand-m5 run gateway processes that never registered a graft receiver, so ATM nudges never reach them and Colima GO dispatches sat unread until a manual nudge" ;
  triage:description "Split from RRG-GRAFT-LEASE-RESTART-001 per quality-mgr verdict at 20:20Z on 2026-09-03. Evidence gathered by fenix@rand-m5 at 20:2xZ, sanitized: graft_receiver_endpoints on rand-m5 has zero rows; loki hermes profile logs contain zero atm_graft.receiver_loop lines at any date; loki gateway process has run since 2026-08-26 with no restart, the remaining m5 hermes fleet since 2026-08-22; the daemon never logs registrations so daemon stderr is non-discriminating. Effect during the readiness run: loki accumulated 77 unread including both Colima GO dispatches and only started after Rand nudged him manually. Classification: release-readiness process and fleet-deployment gap on the rand-m5 host (gateway builds or hook installs predating the hermes-atm graft rollout), outside the PR 1143 candidate diff; PR 1143 is not gated on it. Closure evidence: confirmation of the hermes-atm wheel version and receiver hook plus native-tools plugin install state for the loki profile and one other m5 hermes profile, and, with Rand approval, a loki gateway restart showing a lease row and doctor graft_receivers entry appearing; the readiness plan step 2 host precondition should then state that the Colima host hermes gateway must show a live graft receiver in doctor before GO is dispatched. Update 21:20Z: Rand ruled that hermes does not use tmux and the roster harness for hermes agents must be hermes or nudges are never sent, so loki's own diagnosis (missing recipient pane id) is wrong and the roster harness value for every m5 hermes member is part of the closure evidence. Rand also ruled that host hermes agents must never be pointed at Colima and that Colima must run a separate hermes install with its own .hermes root inside the VM; fenix@rand-m5 paused the tiers at 21:08Z and ordered a corrected VM-internal plan. fenix@rand-m5 disclosed host changes on 2026-09-03: atm-graft plugin enabled for the skillrx profile at 21:05Z and the skillrx gateway killed at 21:07Z to reload (a fleet-record closure experiment, not tier work). The trust entry named localhost predates today (AT-era testbed setup, present since at least 2026-08-29) and is tracked as RRG-TRUST-KEY-LOOPBACK-001." ;
  triage:phaseId "readiness-1.4" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "release-process" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file_only" ;
  triage:status "open" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-03T21:20:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:foundIn triage:RRG-S2 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-03T20:13:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
